Bauru","id":67930504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3OTMwNTA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67930504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru","html_url":"https://github.com/SpockBauru","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-24T20:19:02Z","updated_at":"2025-03-24T20:41:22Z","body":"Indeed the process is deferred, I had to put a delay on the [main function of CSG Terrain](https://github.com/SpockBauru/CSG_Terrain/blob/b6615341137cf4774bb20d3d775250c574fd2279/addons/csg_terrain/csg_terrain.gd#L156) to get proper results, but only now I know why, thanks!\r\n\r\nIt's imperceptible at naked eye since is just one frame in 60fps. This make the issue harder to debug on the new manifold system because it's [a way faster than the old one](https://github.com/SpockBauru/CSG_Terrain/issues/1#issuecomment-2576519231) and being so fast you can't actually see the one frame delay, causing synchronization issues.\r\n\r\nProper documentation is welcomed.\r\n\r\nEdit: Taking a look at the code, seems like I will have to put an extra delay on the bake class. Now I can finally make an extra mesh update while baking.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2749298173/reactions","total_